{"4900890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grr Grr Gnomes", "steam_appid": 4900890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grr Grr Gnomes</strong> is a co-op adventure about tiny gnomes stuck on a very big ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have absolutely no idea what you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/ce3931d65a0d6d9e17935d3a4a4ce98b.poster.avif?t=1788352717\" width=400 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/ce3931d65a0d6d9e17935d3a4a4ce98b.webm?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/ce3931d65a0d6d9e17935d3a4a4ce98b.mp4?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go somewhere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail across the ocean and look for islands that hopefully contain something useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel? Great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food? Nice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horrible creature that immediately starts chasing you? Also possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually you'll have to leave the ship, which is usually when everything starts going wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/671b105ee87e21a983b18d01ec84a2fd.poster.avif?t=1788352717\" width=400 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/671b105ee87e21a983b18d01ec84a2fd.webm?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/671b105ee87e21a983b18d01ec84a2fd.mp4?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steal everything that isn't nailed down</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around islands grabbing anything that looks even slightly useful and drag it back to the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supplies, equipment, weird junk, questionable objects...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can carry it, it's probably coming with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just remember that someone eventually has to make it back to the boat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/9d99a4cb55a743fbb33174f039bc4290.poster.avif?t=1788352717\" width=400 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/9d99a4cb55a743fbb33174f039bc4290.webm?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/9d99a4cb55a743fbb33174f039bc4290.mp4?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get attacked by things</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The islands have residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of them are not happy to see you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight strange creatures, run away from bigger strange creatures, rescue your friends when they do something stupid, and try not to lose half the crew because someone wanted to &quot;check something real quick.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/cc1a3bbc51af0ea59987987c4c7742dc.poster.avif?t=1788352717\" width=400 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/cc1a3bbc51af0ea59987987c4c7742dc.webm?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/cc1a3bbc51af0ea59987987c4c7742dc.mp4?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the boat alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship is the only thing getting you home, so naturally it's going to become everyone's problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep it supplied, keep it moving, and try not to ruin everything before reaching the next island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/c6f06bc3ca4b26400d6d554e0dc5de3c.poster.avif?t=1788352717\" width=400 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/c6f06bc3ca4b26400d6d554e0dc5de3c.webm?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/c6f06bc3ca4b26400d6d554e0dc5de3c.mp4?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Somehow find your way home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every island gets you a little further across the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore weird places, survive increasingly questionable situations, and keep sailing until you finally figure out how to get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or don't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gnomes are doing their best.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grr Grr Gnomes</strong> is a co-op adventure about tiny gnomes stuck on a very big ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have absolutely no idea what you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/ce3931d65a0d6d9e17935d3a4a4ce98b.poster.avif?t=1788352717\" width=400 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/ce3931d65a0d6d9e17935d3a4a4ce98b.webm?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/ce3931d65a0d6d9e17935d3a4a4ce98b.mp4?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go somewhere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail across the ocean and look for islands that hopefully contain something useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel? Great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food? Nice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horrible creature that immediately starts chasing you? Also possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually you'll have to leave the ship, which is usually when everything starts going wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/671b105ee87e21a983b18d01ec84a2fd.poster.avif?t=1788352717\" width=400 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/671b105ee87e21a983b18d01ec84a2fd.webm?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/671b105ee87e21a983b18d01ec84a2fd.mp4?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steal everything that isn't nailed down</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around islands grabbing anything that looks even slightly useful and drag it back to the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supplies, equipment, weird junk, questionable objects...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can carry it, it's probably coming with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just remember that someone eventually has to make it back to the boat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/9d99a4cb55a743fbb33174f039bc4290.poster.avif?t=1788352717\" width=400 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/9d99a4cb55a743fbb33174f039bc4290.webm?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/9d99a4cb55a743fbb33174f039bc4290.mp4?t=1788352717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get attacked by things</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The islands have residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of them are not happy to see you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight strange creatures, run away from bigger strange creatures, rescue your friends when they do something stupid, and try not to lose half the crew because someone wanted to &quot;check something real quick.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/cc1a3bbc51af0ea59987987c4c7742dc.poster.avif?t=1788352717\" width=400 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4900890/extras/cc1a3bbc51af0ea59987987c4c7742dc.webm?t=1788352717\" type=\"